BAHAO ASHQ-E-AZA FATIMA KA HAI MATAM<br>
<br>
 HO NAUHA BINTE PAYAMBAR KA HAM SE KAISE RAQM,<br>
 LARAZTE JAATE HAIN ALFAAZ KANPTA HAI QALAM,<br>
 YE KAISE FATIMA ZEHRA PE TOOTE ZULM-O-SITAM,<br>
 SADA YE GOONJ RAHI HAI FIZAON MEIN PAIHAM<br>
<br>
NABI KI QABAR PA YE BAIN KARTI THI ZEHRA,<br>
 MAIN AB SUNAONGI RUDAD-E-GHAM KISE BABA,<br>
 HAIN PASLIYAN MERI TOOTI SANBHALO MUJHKO ZARA,<br>
 BULALO PAAS MUJHE APNE HOGA MUJH PE KARAM<br>
<br>
ALI SE FATIMA ZEHRA NE PHIR YE FARMAYA,<br>
 KAREIN MAAFH AGAR HOGAYI HO MUJH SE QATA,<br>
 QAYAL RAKHNA MERE BAAD MERE BACHCHON KA,<br>
 KE UNKA AB NAHIN KOI BHI MONIS-O-HAMDAM<br>
<br>
SITAM UTHAI THEIN HAR AAN REHTI THEIN MUZTAR,<br>
 HUI SHAHADAT-E-MOHSIN GIRA JO PEHLU PE DAR,<br>
 YATIM-O-BEKAS O MAZLOOM BINTE PAYGHAM,<br>
 BARGAYEEN ZAMANE SE BIBI UTHA KE RANJ-O-ALAM<br>
<br>
JANAZA FATIMA ZEHRA KA SHAB KI TAARIKI,<br>
 ALI SE BINTE NABI KI YAHI WASIYAT THI,<br>
 ZAMANA BADLA HAI KAISA YE KAISI AYI GHADI,<br>
 USI KI BETIYANBALWE ME AYEEN WAYE SITAM<br>
<br>
RASHEED HOTA THA JIS DAR PA AYATON KA NUZOOL,<br>
 WO BIBI JIS NE NA PAYA SUKOON BAAD-E-RASOOL,<br>
 PIDAR KE GHAM MEIN JO REHTI THI SUBAH-O-SHAAM MALOOL,<br>
 USI KA AHL-E-AZA KAR RAHE HAIN AB MATA..